# The Chief Warg: the ability checks for a creature with power 4 or greater only as the attack is declared (the ruling), not
# again as it resolves. Bot1 attacks with the Warg and an Alpine Grizzly (power 4); with the ability on the stack Bot2 kills the
# Grizzly with Lightning Bolt, and the ability still resolves: Bot1 draws a card and loses 1 life.

